---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Testing & Inspection" description="Full-scale type testing, material testing, and third-party inspection services.">
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <p class="text-brand-500 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Capabilities</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Testing & Inspection</h1>
    <p class="text-steel-500 text-lg mb-12 max-w-3xl">Every tower design is validated through rigorous testing with national test labs.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Testing Capabilities</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-steel-600">
          <li>✓ Full-scale tower type testing (destructive)</li>
          <li>✓ Component proof testing</li>
          <li>✓ Material testing (tensile, impact, chemical)</li>
          <li>✓ Weld inspection (UT, MT, RT)</li>
          <li>✓ Zinc coating thickness measurement</li>
          <li>✓ 100% trial assembly dimensional check</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Third-Party Partners</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-steel-600">
          <li><strong>CEPRI</strong> — Type testing</li>
          <li><strong>XHRI</strong> — High voltage research</li>
          <li><strong>SGS / Bureau Veritas / TÜV</strong> — Pre-shipment inspection</li>
          <li>Client-appointed inspectors always welcome</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/certifications/" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-600 transition-colors">View Certifications →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
